# Build-time API base for production builds (Cloudflare Pages runs `vite build`).
#
# Not a secret — it is compiled into the bundle and visible to anyone using the app. Kept in
# the repo so a Pages build needs no dashboard configuration; override it with a
# VITE_API_BASE_URL environment variable in the Pages project if the API moves.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://eval-api-production.codingclub.workers.dev/api
